{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415700","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415700","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041570001:1":{"text":"啊，真是麻烦……我讨厌工作。","source_cn":"啊，真是麻烦……我讨厌工作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF14C7AB646EC4CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570002:1":{"text":"别误会，不是说具体的某件任务或者某份文件——我讨厌工作本身。","source_cn":"别误会，不是说具体的某件任务或者某份文件——我讨厌工作本身。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7BF637FC750F562","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570003:1":{"text":"同感。","source_cn":"同感。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E6156CD9628EB55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570004:1":{"text":"咦？！真让人意外。我还以为你和因度厄一样，都是个热爱工作且希望所有人都像他一样热爱的工作狂呢。","source_cn":"咦？！真让人意外。我还以为你和因度厄一样，都是个热爱工...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A281688E11C13A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570005:1":{"text":"并非如此。\n我承担目前的职责与工作，完全是出于责任心。","source_cn":"并非如此。\\n我承担目前的职责与工作，完全是出于责任心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0000EB1E067DE7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570006:1":{"text":"如果我撒手不管，那么就无人可做，一切就会变得一团混乱。","source_cn":"如果我撒手不管，那么就无人可做，一切就会变得一团混乱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x377721930ED70A61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570007:1":{"text":"但我必须声明，这份责任心绝非无限，只要有机会，我会希望把这一切都交付给它们原本的主人。","source_cn":"但我必须声明，这份责任心绝非无限，只要有机会，我会希望...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98EEB59EF5CF4DF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570008:1":{"text":"——无论是权力，职责，还是无穷无尽的工作本身。","source_cn":"——无论是权力，职责，还是无穷无尽的工作本身。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DCBB8DBE6EAF3BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570009:1":{"text":"说得妙极了，我真不该凭着他人的三言两语就错判了你的个性。","source_cn":"说得妙极了，我真不该凭着他人的三言两语就错判了你的个性。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47527F5AE0E5B2CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570010:1":{"text":"仔细瞧瞧，你也是个面具爱好者——我是说，我感觉我们会聊得来，亲爱的朋友。","source_cn":"仔细瞧瞧，你也是个面具爱好者——我是说，我感觉我们会聊...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67455EE90889E5F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041570011:1":{"text":"不如我们换个更安静的地方，聊聊如何改善情况的详细计划，如何？","source_cn":"不如我们换个更安静的地方，聊聊如何改善情况的详细计划，如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF40EFADA1387F3EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041570012:1":{"text":"不，这无需多谈，我早就有了详细的计划，只是缺少实施机会。","source_cn":"不，这无需多谈，我早就有了详细的计划，只是缺少实施机会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5898B9F2A850F5B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041570013:1":{"text":"第一步：等那两个在外游历的家伙回来。第二步：把他们捉住，捆在自己该在的位置上。","source_cn":"第一步：等那两个在外游历的家伙回来。第二步：把他们捉住...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F4D0BDC83782C8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041570014:1":{"text":"第三步：以我有限的责任心，承担属于我的有限的责任。第四步：愉快地享受宁静的人生。以上。","source_cn":"第三步：以我有限的责任心，承担属于我的有限的责任。第四...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB282D5971A35D48E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041570015:1":{"text":"目前来说，我尽管想执行第二步，但他们总在我来得及执行前就找到理由逃跑了。","source_cn":"目前来说，我尽管想执行第二步，但他们总在我来得及执行前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA528BCE007703BF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041570016:1":{"text":"…………\n啊呀，这听起来真是不幸。","source_cn":"…………\\n啊呀，这听起来真是不幸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x450D87E6AD7272FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041570017:1":{"text":"确实。\n不过幸好，此前闲聊时，因度厄曾说过，在这方面他颇有心得。","source_cn":"确实。\\n不过幸好，此前闲聊时，因度厄曾说过，在这方面...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A59978005B6D883","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041570018:1":{"text":"因此，我曾向他请教过相关的经验，但他好像还没回信……","source_cn":"因此，我曾向他请教过相关的经验，但他好像还没回信……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9168572DB10E4488","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041570019:1":{"text":"……呃……\n说起来，我亲爱的朋友，这种话题在你这位长着羽毛的美丽女伴面前是不是过于沉重了？","source_cn":"……呃……\\n说起来，我亲爱的朋友，这种话题在你这位长...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A5FFB5059E54A9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041570020:1":{"text":"看在咱们共同的漂亮面具的份上，换个轻松的话题吧？","source_cn":"看在咱们共同的漂亮面具的份上，换个轻松的话题吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DF74496B9CB5ED9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:沙利叶":{"text":"沙利叶","source":"沙利叶","status":"source"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"布莱恩","source":"布莱恩","status":"source"}},